{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1429,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45582267def147ecb1dc270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打倒中央……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b45ea87c6605b2086bce904833d69adeb35b9412093253c8af5ba8e99a32c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be382009146915d72cd93163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了履行那天的誓言——\r\n船桥之星，将会比任何人都要闪耀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef617e1fc899645f6ec8df9ad24c6cb9fcd1d9c0b8eda0543fb632e9c774e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32675da862812fce07892c7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是通过歌声，我也会让大家铭记船桥的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d6f5470dcbbfd486a17e25ce57bac8136ff98f483e7b3320211b2cb9b89b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7db06f9512b6c9a8100c2a11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了报答那些支持我的人们……\r\n我会竭尽全力去歌唱的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8f20aeed194bb8095137621f21b1afd7d2f6cbf0ed6c70dc3834cf5a10787a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a3e2db34c403ee23275cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油吧，为了故乡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd4fd68bbd9eacfb9a360f35590c99aedd32db92259dedab8547d9f6159750ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e164ec9584402a39e3c5079a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在等着你。\r\n谢谢你没有放弃，朝着故乡——朝着我\r\n伸出了你的手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55744b0f32631c29ee45f4737ff9987009b4c36adb9fa5ba1052dc899de8fb31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be7e46d1d55bc71215c14bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着必须完美。\r\n因为我不想被看轻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e44f312cec4b6931b4130d98d6c4b053cf30c33c84e87dd6b2735b765284218",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2483137b7646dc3a4289428f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然觉得有些太华丽了……\r\n不，必须习惯才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6535a799b54d73e5e55ee2f3ae90491f53cfe19743e598ce15a632bf3bc085a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758965572b3350cba1c54a47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为『船桥之星』，\r\n我会成为照亮未来的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b178f719750a40a15f9437faadf98a259bf5af36883133b41165d4ac51317358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5a48ec55ae89f79d343bbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为船桥的代表，\r\n我会过好无愧于此的学园生活……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4987ef1abfc0c45aaf95b947dfec212a6eb121bbd2fc45d8158669d49443e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339b67b42b5e33b1e1ee4e0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在所有领域，我都要赢过中央。\r\n无论是唱歌，还是跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a886b9e2f82aa916a84ab348f58c9f65fa385447aa28877750e119764d9d010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cd4c1fe456f2365d0ed26b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的天空与大海……真是个不错的意象。\r\n纵使离去，心亦相随。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ca3a332075d8335385107b380f7f7d9392cef1f71c33ff9216a78cdae3f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac40ee0fd3a8208ee085471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d54599ab00476499fd927897da007b95eee1c32ce0950ff8b6774bd786b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c653bf7c08114b8989eac87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装齐整，姿态端正。\r\n无论何时被人看见都没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab12772b9523cd483b6a3f807e6c40696731eab71e9d51c7fa29718520de4160",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08a0363d929433c50c1296f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休息的时候，\r\n要回一趟船桥吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d73710523f9abdcc7c71b6bce11a43d12e85b5b60084e1101797f4ad2eedb3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e7e5b94ad64c0b017071119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了方便活动，\r\n这个长度正好合适呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53302721df9611a4f90645670552130867c5b60f58a546f309dc3a511dead7c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00dba1a252a9dccc6d57e7b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着必须完美。\r\n因为我不想被看轻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e44f312cec4b6931b4130d98d6c4b053cf30c33c84e87dd6b2735b765284218",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e2febd268a667682249638",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然觉得有些太华丽了……\r\n不，必须习惯才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6535a799b54d73e5e55ee2f3ae90491f53cfe19743e598ce15a632bf3bc085a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3a327c0e34008e04781292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为『船桥之星』，\r\n我会成为照亮未来的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b178f719750a40a15f9437faadf98a259bf5af36883133b41165d4ac51317358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b9d4ac26c6f35a553410a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为船桥的代表，\r\n我会过好无愧于此的学园生活……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4987ef1abfc0c45aaf95b947dfec212a6eb121bbd2fc45d8158669d49443e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d5e806f4a098e4ef38b154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在所有领域，我都要赢过中央。\r\n无论是唱歌，还是跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a886b9e2f82aa916a84ab348f58c9f65fa385447aa28877750e119764d9d010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a89a0734d3ea84b756efef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的天空与大海……真是个不错的意象。\r\n纵使离去，心亦相随。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ca3a332075d8335385107b380f7f7d9392cef1f71c33ff9216a78cdae3f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a342abc4730164aee202b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d54599ab00476499fd927897da007b95eee1c32ce0950ff8b6774bd786b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82462f35371228de2b9bf3de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装齐整，姿态端正。\r\n无论何时被人看见都没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab12772b9523cd483b6a3f807e6c40696731eab71e9d51c7fa29718520de4160",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba1605c3e7d75ec685509734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c8cba16649be71cfcafcf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。愿荣光如晨曦般，\r\n遍洒船桥——\r\n今日也请与我一同精进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d191cd45f0e841581466f9307591417a6f03ea48afbaf9e06d20ca2543a2c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d15b322705a908e27f7d836e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服没有褶皱，头发没有睡乱。\r\n……是的。今天也是一位体面的\r\n『船桥』训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2329a22c80b5a04e33a2a16d08393d82a859d660ad23852c6ee7cf86d487bbc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9de309135ab3f7e39934336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是中央，咖啡厅的菜单也很\r\n丰富呢。我的便当……\r\n在营养素方面也不会输哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ae6d3a9cb5ef9655814456a8e41c2500049c920b4cacdec409cb27ee7f9fca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9536dd9188f242e664381b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "武将和破坏神，究竟谁更厉害之类的事\r\n我才不关心。……午休时间\r\n我只想安安静静地度过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8596354390e51128fcfcb9f6bd39feb88407a121b5b2b3e01c54f67704631d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fae3c040d7d387cc8f5ec14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不把疲劳带到明天，早点\r\n休息吧。想要与中央对抗，\r\n必须保持万全的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a9d2291ad343b6130369f5b2196638739c625cad2644ba3e2ed18ae06c5b65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:665a39c5a6b842b5702fc35f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上的超市，就是一种战场。\r\n围绕打折熟食的激战——\r\n我会拼尽全力，赢下这一局的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377e145bb4a013292923bcb054c51cce387097d8ff0bf8481f2beaa52c7df39e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef86c8359d836634b0a5285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的海边是贝类的宝库。\r\n……周末，要不要再一起去海滩\r\n进行『狩猎』呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c562193d088dce090dd5a210b527d4024b48d9e272d8a40ca6ce8c084024ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb5b3f2d77dbfbfe4f52d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，这股暑气果然还是……\r\n让我稍微有点，\r\n想念海风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16558d2562e66fa0b20f9dfcb9c3994996493d1a7015ef361be66bcccded8229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5800873baf44eb52182d582b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了红腹滨鹬\r\n来到三番濑的季节了呢。\r\n每年的那个啼鸣声，都让我倍感治愈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a103cd6b5326b0b0a54db503341eeb39d23ba43a1e1f7e79800a2ba34b746b6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd63fed974c76b24b66c730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪要是积起来就能滑雪了……\r\n只要别下得太离谱，\r\n我反而很欢迎呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23642ad9b4b2b6663a2402f497b1bb80e35244c4aef4693090130b1dd9b8e1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d1379fe4512893beeb10ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a37197351e029acda65968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又……帮她写作业了。\n虽然很不甘心，但不得不承认\n莫名其妙同学确实是个策士……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1171edacb224b470e36edad294e610f314203ecedfd1c8b9a12a3e8beffdb04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e798d16f3411f8defb44580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子同学是一位不容小觑的人。\n在她那轻飘飘又可爱的外表下，\n能感受到深不可测的强大实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "480443e27fabba8ca6fed7f38028ad2b1ca0adf5674bcf6c76d3fea832dece5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6618ee435d99bf8c8686a819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用船桥的特产，从创升同学那里\n换取情报……这不是什么茶话会，\n而是利益交换。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e099e105a35e978e34075c0de0a1011dbd13ff6a7ee5e095b47cb0a62cdb60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c675554569380f24ead71964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之城同学每隔几天就会\n送我一些『剩下的菜』——\n她难道是在减重吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee4b9d3be6c814c956be635db49d200e0b33b97cb295e19cf69a5a59acf862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565ec5a6c424119d9e76365b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏小姐……在某种意义上，\n是最危险的。那种仿佛老家般的\n安心感……简直难以抗拒……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae0da9e92ff20a795782f576d08f8e464d85a6b96238cebe55508adaadc01f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2a4eb2962a8699372ed1ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是同样的衣装，才更能如实反映出\r\n实力的差距……即使是演唱会，\r\n我也会展现出胜过中央的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9b043ae4e8c528c5b71a6e1b036fe15875e76bcbd804f843a76ee54a3163cf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ba01c79b9034b2e8145c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是中央的审美吗……。\r\n这种受众广泛的设计，\r\n我也必须和奔跑技巧一起去学习才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3f037c18aab76d18d4958f567850aacdb5d5e47988ad61ced10473ad666af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661678f729315e0781b37087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承载着我们以及船桥心愿的\r\n决胜服……是多么令我自豪，\r\n又多么令我怜爱啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22dda5127bec0dd722214e43204a4681e4cacda06b98ff10f9b1356351c818f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f01046af0fd811f058e8dc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背后的视觉效果如何？\r\n船桥的『F』，必须得\r\n让它清晰可见才行……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2f6005463ac193d10047ca9c53f2abb90c10091d7a215ed2455a31dbfc114b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e924d366554c42d5f8031cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚来的时候，每次早上醒来，\r\n都会对陌生的天花板感到困惑。\r\n……虽然现在已经一点点习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e81143a39e36f745fd2721e24b9f44dcefdc510c596d21a575302e544f1ff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1e0d29a9f86904c109683b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉拌小松菜，\n我做得比以前更美味了呢。\n下次，您能帮我尝尝味道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "690d5be6958e476e21b947db10710700180946e654f0f10efdd02b8407a943e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf682518efc8e30bd3cab42d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有……必须要赢的“理由”。\r\n来吧，堂堂正正地一战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5f19946810801fed66712f8c087eb5ebe912dfb6b4954fc276e570dfe3dc650",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db94642b934005565141740e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，深夜绝对不该打开LANE。\r\n我和朋友都不知道该什么时候停手。\r\n……那东西太危险了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba0c638234a3c5e172b074fd595392ad08a201472afafee6cedbf3fb8b9c5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e3c067cf786f075b03a104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说公园和慢跑道上的\r\n樱花都满开了哦。\r\n……回老家的期待又增加了一分呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00764ae9c581f1763af3f2ec71468ccf5c209e53971a97e13e569f340321ef1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4dd2a29f9991ffc3be94ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节食物容易腐坏，真让人头疼。\r\n把寄来的蔬菜冻起来，\r\n做成奶昔喝掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "963a4dc6d2160ce43dc63d0354c228664c22e03c0e79748fb15285c6d15b1a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9a2d3f56526330381b32ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的农水产祭也令人期待呢。\r\n难得有机会，\r\n回老家的时候一起去逛逛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a734ac987243d456e176b23b64b61f5d01c55a5650fd73c7c59ab37c4d0ca43d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:044c89affa6c6bff33e65c20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷的冬天，\n就要吃热腾腾的拉面……。\n这正是推广辣酱拉面的好机会呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e574096725c600c3b8756a828c1d31118f9ca3852178b0dd5cf7882312e1e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6480766c7af39a79123952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作已万无一失。\r\n为了开辟故乡的未来，\r\n我们快点开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15fa2641549206422d9721ad1b3e95a4977bd8fdffe1f51a9c9805955810509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b891cb0a1f320373f596a497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59afd29fd5a04099caf4cab055710f0949ac04e6515b6dd7d5b095acdac38f47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9873656ffb3556d933e8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔。虽然这里的器材和设施很完善，\r\n但绝对不可以倒戈哦。\r\n……记住了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a979f1bcae992069ae062fb2052238ff3233f03d631f13f1a099b9d3b32d9265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940d37c59353197af3d6def0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "故乡的未来，全担负在我们两人身上。\r\n无论是知识还是技术，\r\n我们都要统统吸收过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01df6894481800337f081971af6eadc3c1a3ada287e153961391ab01d9538a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7bf1bcb3efed5c3564696c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始前先提振一下士气吧。\r\n来，一起喊——\r\n『打倒中央！船桥最强！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ac4d56117372171b4f1d38e43e8a14d815fb4e61d9fdf1c21d99ad4a4c71de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd55c625971c8349b6c8d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们和船桥都在\r\n一点点地发生改变。\r\n就这样不放弃地继续前行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740dc7bca6571ab9d793d33766bfc57bc28e74239a9716c8a326e0fc4613bfd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:355e81633c58d238627d2175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的眼光果然没错。\r\n能与你这位同志并肩同行，\r\n我至今仍深感自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b1b77bb5f3529ed7a683b8cad9fa84df5230817cb137c6cdefb2aab99d7016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe470d3a04052baf85766b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦想终会成真。\r\n既然是共同跨越了泪水、不甘与愤怒的我们，\r\n就一定没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03dc10ddf59e3c0424aea58dac6faf80c298eb3ed8209f5167131c1819f5a010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed1d8fec460d364154841e45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的大家，想必此刻也正在\r\n为了合宿而努力吧。\r\n……我们也绝不能输呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a040410c307acc81b3aa3c44dae710b68166b8d68973ba78be7729b39c4c47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3531a528b98019a2771f3a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凯旋而归吧，回到我们的故乡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba260c654af1b030b34a95d09f2dfdfbf76dd0fc615b6414fb319aa47a536f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73245befdd044fac11cdae19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "取得了足以向大家夸耀的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b573da4e14dc3ac10e5a3bcd432305630cb427cb44c55fdbb3f747e110e477df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd095ef46dc9635744e7feec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这股力量，为船桥赢取……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2808a477862ec7d864f844fb058b53470f6bc8c9f52d3cef46254da68c9dc600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ccaba89e90669d93d2cb38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样一来，\r\n就不会输给中央的那些猛将了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d1664d081ccaf13c19f698fe6577a70e50706926e4b8879e8320564f04975b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354cfb6c65c89b578f867715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是来自船桥的，狂怒乐章。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0743cc8fc0e71acdffc5f6de0f3b83006d599ddfe26d8eb5014b5db970477737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53aca66e43e2e1e253468f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之故乡，我之骄傲——\r\n荣光尽在船桥……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5a3f372f4fd3e2e279097c2da8666e5da87b61a0477d9220e711e7fc5c4d73f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53967620ae312511f8f8d7c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますか～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddfa6a8b8fa76ef639759cc8d4d7fa4805ca79e3d1ad63f5f68d765d9d98467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546d7666a2a90b62fead72ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい娘を担当できたね～。\r\nまだまだ伝えてない情報もあるから\r\n乞うご期待、ってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc773143deaa86537c44f063dbeb57db162c4c9974cdf52f82fc4f102e87388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f69cf69e06ab64eeb4c229",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよーん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "112bac4caec9c3e12da908fe5d5c038b8724a6d184c5d148c107c9df55dc25de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58bec9e386a53cc3e1dd4513",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6996f712b68911270456925ca6e20a9f967e284f6c6f6c224220afedf071e615",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efecd6d0f7b1115628a178a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバイ相手、読めない展開。\r\nもっとゾクゾクするレース、\r\nキミとなら味わえるっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "339a6bdf7860d10737c85ab828b84c2f0275a9f1b4fd13dcdb1b3c7ab85b5c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c377475fb5965ab430f0b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほーんと罪なトレちゃんだよね～。\r\nウチの予測、ぽーんと超えて\r\nくれちゃってさ。このこの～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e9d6ea672edf4f31ce4fbfcd6e0d44e7694fd35b5156c914aef6c8de7d588d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dd040697f002b2734d07dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『思わず目を背けたくなる福袋』と\r\n『心臓が飛び出す福袋』…\r\nふふ～、どっちから開けよっかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "524b9821ce1949f61649978301bc39b84e1a9d4dad38dfcad33323872f608380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db33b8e0b067fe77b5b98190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有名どころの新作チョコなら、\r\nほぼ買えたよん。気になるのが\r\nあれば、わけたげるけど？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7575879dd9b087e3b033cc9c719a6243024ed40039bc73573d7ceed260a9ea35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca9392442986ce8090299356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好きなだけチョコ食べちゃおうぜい\r\nピラミッドできるくらい積んでさ～\r\n今日くらい、いいじゃ～ん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e63aa15ff2a3507f19db19c9f73de72f050aa3c718cce2702ed7a5621f8ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a88f7274a7fdd1a651f4a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あとで高台に集合よろ。\r\nデジタル望遠鏡で、空に流れる\r\n川を見せてしんぜよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde17ea9f257f8bbc39dbfa5bbe40432c8193438bddd979a00b0c1394547ab4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8371dcfcfd9b7c7c5c18ccfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハロウィンか～。ガチの仮装、\r\n興味ある？かーさん直伝の\r\n特殊メイク、披露してあげよーう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3dd709bb4f2a4b9468ff69f9d15fdca689769b7ffc357075bee0803abc732f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cef1e5a72c940a031159479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サンタって資格試験あんだよね。\r\nトレちゃん、合格して\r\nウチにプレゼントちょ～だ～い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "898d8e60ba46c1e1fc303f23124aa6005ff39138fbac4fb6b046993a9ae134a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
